<title>DUBAI: Caltex lifts posted product prices ex-Bahrain.</title>
<headline>Caltex lifts posted product prices ex-Bahrain.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caltex has increased its middle distillate, naphtha and gasoline posted prices from Bahrain effective Wednesday, the company said.</p>
<p>Gas oil with 0.5 percent sulphur content is now 78 cents a gallon from 75 cents while dual purpose kerosene is lifted one cent to 80 cents a gallon.</p>
<p>Whole naphtha is up three cents at 54 cents a gallon while 97 octane gasoline with 0.15 percent lead content is five cents higher at 76 cents a gallon.</p>
<p>The price increases follow surging Gulf product markets.</p>
<p>-- Dubai Newsroom, +971 4 6071255</p>
</text>
